<title>LATVIA: CENTRAL BANK SETS UNCHANGED DEPOSIT RATE.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK SETS UNCHANGED DEPOSIT RATE.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank on Monday set an unchanged 31-day deposit rate of 1.5 percent.</p>
<p>The central bank said in a statement that banks can deposit funds on August 18 with a repayment date of September 18.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
